            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-53667",
              "name": "CVE-2026-53667 in react-router 7.15.1 (untrusted redirect via missing protocol validation)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-53667 in react-router 7.15.1 (untrusted redirect via missing protocol validation)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The desktop client resolves `react-router` `7.15.1` through `react-router-dom`, which is within the affected range for `CVE-2026-53667`. The advisory describes untrusted redirects due to missing protocol validation and is fixed in `7.18.0`."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The desktop client resolves `react-router` `7.15.1` through `react-router-dom`, which is within the affected range for `CVE-2026-53667`. The advisory describes untrusted redirects due to missing protocol validation and is fixed in `7.18.0`.\n\nIf the affected navigation helpers are reachable, attacker-controlled routes or redirect targets can send users to unexpected destinations and enable phishing pivots or token leakage through redirect abuse.\n\nUpgrade `react-router-dom` and the resolved `react-router` dependency to `7.18.0` or later, then regenerate the lockfile so the vulnerable version is no longer selected.",
                "markdown": "The desktop client resolves `react-router` `7.15.1` through `react-router-dom`, which is within the affected range for `CVE-2026-53667`. The advisory describes untrusted redirects due to missing protocol validation and is fixed in `7.18.0`.\n\nIf the affected navigation helpers are reachable, attacker-controlled routes or redirect targets can send users to unexpected destinations and enable phishing pivots or token leakage through redirect abuse.\n\nUpgrade `react-router-dom` and the resolved `react-router` dependency to `7.18.0` or later, then regenerate the lockfile so the vulnerable version is no longer selected."
              },
              "properties": {
