            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-53669",
              "name": "CVE-2026-53669 in react-router 7.15.1 (open redirect via backslashes in navigation components)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-53669 in react-router 7.15.1 (open redirect via backslashes in navigation components)"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The desktop client resolves `react-router` `7.15.1` through `react-router-dom`, which is within the affected range for `CVE-2026-53669`. The advisory describes an open redirect issue via backslashes in navigation components and is fixed in `7.18.0`."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The desktop client resolves `react-router` `7.15.1` through `react-router-dom`, which is within the affected range for `CVE-2026-53669`. The advisory describes an open redirect issue via backslashes in navigation components and is fixed in `7.18.0`.\n\nIf the affected navigation components are reachable, crafted backslash-delimited destinations can redirect users to attacker-controlled pages and weaken trust in in-app navigation.\n\nUpgrade `react-router-dom` and the resolved `react-router` dependency to `7.18.0` or later, then refresh the lockfile so the vulnerable version is removed.",
                "markdown": "The desktop client resolves `react-router` `7.15.1` through `react-router-dom`, which is within the affected range for `CVE-2026-53669`. The advisory describes an open redirect issue via backslashes in navigation components and is fixed in `7.18.0`.\n\nIf the affected navigation components are reachable, crafted backslash-delimited destinations can redirect users to attacker-controlled pages and weaken trust in in-app navigation.\n\nUpgrade `react-router-dom` and the resolved `react-router` dependency to `7.18.0` or later, then refresh the lockfile so the vulnerable version is removed."
              },
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "5.1",
                "tags": [
