            {
              "id": "CWE-862",
              "name": "Unauthorized student profile disclosure via `GET /api/usuarios/{id}`",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unauthorized student profile disclosure via `GET /api/usuarios/{id}`"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A low-privilege authenticated student can retrieve another student's profile by ID. The response includes private account and academic metadata such as email, RA, semester, interests, institution, and preferences without any ownership check."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A low-privilege authenticated student can retrieve another student's profile by ID. The response includes private account and academic metadata such as email, RA, semester, interests, institution, and preferences without any ownership check.\n\nAn authenticated student can read another student's restricted profile data by guessing or enumerating the user ID. In the validated request, the response disclosed the victim's email and `RA`/profile fields, enabling cross-account privacy leakage and user enumeration.\n\nRestrict `UsuarioService.validarAcessoAoUsuario()` so that cross-user reads are allowed only for explicitly authorized roles and relationships. At minimum, require the caller to be the same user, an administrator, or an orientador when student records are intentionally visible; add regression tests for both `GET /api/usuarios/{id}` and `GET /api/usuarios/{id}/perfil` to ensure another student receives `403 Forbidden`.",
                "markdown": "A low-privilege authenticated student can retrieve another student's profile by ID. The response includes private account and academic metadata such as email, RA, semester, interests, institution, and preferences without any ownership check.\n\nAn authenticated student can read another student's restricted profile data by guessing or enumerating the user ID. In the validated request, the response disclosed the victim's email and `RA`/profile fields, enabling cross-account privacy leakage and user enumeration.\n\nRestrict `UsuarioService.validarAcessoAoUsuario()` so that cross-user reads are allowed only for explicitly authorized roles and relationships. At minimum, require the caller to be the same user, an administrator, or an orientador when student records are intentionally visible; add regression tests for both `GET /api/usuarios/{id}` and `GET /api/usuarios/{id}/perfil` to ensure another student receives `403 Forbidden`."
              },
              "properties": {
                "security-severity": "4.3",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "CWE-862",
                  "stride:E"
                ]
              },
              "helpUri": "https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/862.html"
            }
          ],
          "version": "1.5.3"
        }
      },
