            "text": "Unauthorized student profile disclosure via `GET /api/usuarios/{id}`\n\nA low-privilege authenticated student can retrieve another student's profile by ID. The response includes private account and academic metadata such as email, RA, semester, interests, institution, and preferences without any ownership check."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
