          "fixes": [
            {
              "artifactChanges": [
                {
                  "artifactLocation": {
                    "uri": "backend/tcc-backend/src/main/java/com/example/tcc_backend/service/UsuarioService.java"
                  },
                  "replacements": [
                    {
                      "deletedRegion": {
                        "startLine": 244,
                        "endLine": 260
                      },
                      "insertedContent": {
                        "text": "private void validarAcessoAoUsuario(Usuario usuario, boolean permitirOrientador) {\n        Usuario usuarioLogado = authHelper.getCurrentUser();\n\n        if (usuarioLogado.getId().equals(usuario.getId())) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (usuarioLogado.getTipo() == TipoUsuario.ADMIN) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        if (permitirOrientador\n                && usuarioLogado.getTipo() == TipoUsuario.ORIENTADOR\n                && usuario.getTipo() == TipoUsuario.ALUNO) {\n            return;\n        }\n\n        throw new ResponseStatusException(HttpStatus.FORBIDDEN, \"Sem permissao para acessar dados de outro usuario\");\n    }"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "description": {
                "text": "Restrict `UsuarioService.validarAcessoAoUsuario()` so that cross-user reads are allowed only for explicitly authorized roles and relationships. At minimum, require the caller to be the same user, an administrator, or an orientador when student records are intentionally visible; add regression tests for both `GET /api/usuarios/{id}` and `GET /api/usuarios/{id}/perfil` to ensure another student receives `403 Forbidden`.",
                "markdown": "Restrict `UsuarioService.validarAcessoAoUsuario()` so that cross-user reads are allowed only for explicitly authorized roles and relationships. At minimum, require the caller to be the same user, an administrator, or an orientador when student records are intentionally visible; add regression tests for both `GET /api/usuarios/{id}` and `GET /api/usuarios/{id}/perfil` to ensure another student receives `403 Forbidden`."
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
